sentences.text:
This order will remain operative subject to compliance of the following conditions by the applicants :-
1. The applicant/s will comply with all the terms and conditions of the bond executed by them;
2. The applicant/s will cooperate in the investigation/trial, as the case may be;
3. The applicant/s will not indulge herself/himself/themselves in extending inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade them/her/him from disclosing such facts to the Court or to the Police Officer, as the case may be;
4.

